{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"As the Owl descends, Secel gives Johnathan a smile and a kiss. \"See you ground side.\" She then... lets go. \n\nDown below a slightly on fire goblin Redcoat screams a challenge at the High Priestess, but is cut off by a Tiefling dropping onto it's skull and flattening it. She grunts as she takes a few steps away. \"Alright, who's next? How about you, good sir?\" She points to a redcoat with a pistol and sword. \"I challenge you to a duel of honor!\"\n\n\"You?\" The man spits. \"Come then, I have bested stronger foes than you!\" \n\nSecel smiles and walks towards the man, and very nearly gets shot! \"Cheating bastard!\" She yells as she rushes him. \"No honor indeed!\"\n\nThey than begin dueling, maul against sword. **Ching! Ching! Clang! Swish!** Secel lets out a small grunt as blood from freshly opened wound across her cheek flows freely. The Brit smiles as he goes for another blow, but she slaps the blade aside and spins, ( spoiler for slight gore ) ||ramming a horn into one of the man's eyes.|| The man screams in pain as she then silences him forever with a single swing, launching the body a few feet to the side by his head.","created_at":"2021-08-26T07:09:23.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880348185313296404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
